# Patterns are root-anchored by default: use **/ so nested build artifacts
# (sdks/typescript/node_modules, dist, __pycache__) stay out of the context.
.git
.env
**/keystore/
**/*.tsr
**/*.key
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
coverage.out
deploy/
# The ops image vendors the TSA root CA:
!deploy/freetsa/cacert.pem
docs/
sdks/
demo/
loadtest/
